{
  "title": "The Hypnic Jerk",
  "slug": "hypnic-jerk",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "name": "Hypnic Jerk",
      "beats": [
        {
          "vo": "The hypnic jerk. You're lying in bed, warm and heavy, finally starting to drift off to sleep.",
          "scene": "story",
          "room": "bedroom-night",
          "emotion": "sleepy",
          "camera": "slowZoom",
          "chapterStart": true,
          "mascots": [
            { "costume": "pajamas", "pose": "sitting-up-in-bed", "emotion": "sleepy", "accessory": "nightcap", "x": 660, "y": 520, "scale": 1.25, "talking": true, "lookDir": "center" }
          ],
          "props": [
            { "name": "blanket", "x": 660, "y": 812, "scale": 1.0 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "vo": "Then, out of nowhere, your whole body twitches, and for a split second it feels like you're falling.",
          "scene": "story",
          "room": "bedroom-night",
          "emotion": "terrified",
          "camera": { "zoomTo": [0.42, 0.46, 1.3] },
          "mascots": [
            { "costume": "pajamas", "pose": "sitting-up-in-bed", "emotion": "terrified", "accessory": "nightcap", "x": 660, "y": 520, "scale": 1.25, "talking": true }
          ],
          "props": [
            { "name": "blanket", "x": 660, "y": 812, "scale": 1.0 },
            { "name": "red-arrow", "x": 1120, "y": 540, "scale": 1.2, "appearAt": 6, "args": { "dir": "down" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "vo": "Maybe you were dreaming of missing a step on the stairs, or tipping backward off a chair, right as it happened.",
          "scene": "story",
          "room": "bedroom-night",
          "emotion": "confused",
          "camera": "static",
          "mascots": [
            { "costume": "pajamas", "pose": "sitting-up-in-bed", "emotion": "confused", "accessory": "nightcap", "x": 660, "y": 520, "scale": 1.25, "talking": true }
          ],
          "props": [
            { "name": "blanket", "x": 660, "y": 812, "scale": 1.0 },
            { "name": "thought-bubble", "x": 1180, "y": 420, "scale": 1.3, "appearAt": 8 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "vo": "That twitch happens right as you slip from being awake down into the first light stages of sleep.",
          "scene": "diagramCard",
          "diagram": "sleep-stage",
          "highlight": "rem",
          "emotion": "serious-expert",
          "withMascot": true
        },
        {
          "vo": "On the way down, your muscles go limp, and your brain's activity begins to wind down for the night.",
          "scene": "explainer",
          "prop": "lightning-cloud",
          "emotion": "happy-talk"
        },
        {
          "vo": "For a moment, it's as if your mind and your body fall slightly out of sync with each other.",
          "scene": "diagramCard",
          "diagram": "switchboard",
          "emotion": "confused",
          "withMascot": true
        },
        {
          "vo": "And you are far from alone. Around seventy percent of people have felt a hypnic jerk at some point.",
          "scene": "statCard",
          "value": 70,
          "suffix": "%",
          "pictogram": "crowd",
          "fraction": 0.7,
          "emotion": "excited"
        },
        {
          "vo": "One popular idea is that your brain misreads those relaxing muscles as a real fall, and fires a quick jolt to catch you.",
          "scene": "explainer",
          "prop": "red-arrow",
          "emotion": "happy-talk"
        },
        {
          "vo": "Either way, it's completely harmless. Just your nervous system settling in. So take a breath, and let yourself drift.",
          "scene": "closeUp",
          "subject": "face",
          "emotion": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
